// FIXME: This passes currently because the module.modulemap file is in UTF-8
// and no conversion is happening when the file is opened.

// Test `-verify` with an early explicit reference to a module.modulemap file.
// The module.modulemap file needs to be handled like other source files (i.e.,
// it should be converted).
//
// Input files were converted using `uconv -f UTF-8 -t IBM1047_LF`.

// verify-modulemap.c:
// ```
// // expected-error@InputCharsetIBM1047/module.modulemap:2 {{expected '{'}}
// #include "InputCharsetIBM1047/empty.h"
// ```

// module.modulemap:
// ```
// module A
// ```

// RUN: %clang_cc1 -verify -finput-charset IBM-1047 -fmodules -fimplicit-module-maps -I %S/Inputs %S/Inputs/InputCharsetIBM1047/verify-modulemap.c
